WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.808
Mandy’s hair was wet from her bath.

2
00:00:05.809 --> 00:00:08.808
She heard a knock on her door.

3
00:00:08.809 --> 00:00:11.478
Vinnie came into her room.

4
00:00:11.479 --> 00:00:15.145
"I need to talk to you," he said.

5
00:00:15.146 --> 00:00:21.949
"We can talk tomorrow," Mandy said sleepily.

6
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.218
"It’ll be too late.

7
00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:28.364
We have to talk now," Vinnie said.

8
00:00:28.365 --> 00:00:34.747
Mandy sighed. "Okay, what?"

9
00:00:34.748 --> 00:00:40.552
"Jordan and Scarlet are coming over tomorrow," Vinnie said.

10
00:00:40.553 --> 00:00:44.017
"Oh no!" she cried.

11
00:00:44.018 --> 00:00:49.586
Their cousins Jordan and Scarlet were seven-year-old twins.

12
00:00:49.587 --> 00:00:53.214
And they were completely wild!

13
00:00:53.215 --> 00:00:56.393
They loved to play hide-and-seek.

14
00:00:56.394 --> 00:01:03.624
But this game mostly involved poking around in other people’s stuff.

15
00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:08.929
"What if they go in the attic?" asked Vinnie.

16
00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:15.017
"We can’t let them find the album!" Mandy whispered.

17
00:01:15.018 --> 00:01:19.074
"We have to hide it," said her brother.

18
00:01:19.075 --> 00:01:21.276
Mandy nodded.

19
00:01:21.277 --> 00:01:28.466
Quietly the children went up to the attic, and Mandy picked up the album.

20
00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:32.008
"Where should we put it?" she asked.

21
00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:34.180
She looked around.

22
00:01:34.181 --> 00:01:39.091
But now, Vinnie was thinking of something else.

23
00:01:39.092 --> 00:01:44.288
"Hey, let’s take one more trip," he said.

24
00:01:44.289 --> 00:01:47.002
Mandy shook her head.

25
00:01:47.003 --> 00:01:50.285
"I’m too tired, Vinnie."

26
00:01:50.286 --> 00:01:59.166
"But with Jordan and Scarlet here," said Vinnie, "we may not be able to go for a while."

27
00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:04.068
"But I just had a bath," Mandy whined.

28
00:02:04.069 --> 00:02:07.116
"Come on, it’ll be fun."

29
00:02:07.117 --> 00:02:10.573
Vinnie took the album from her hands.

30
00:02:10.574 --> 00:02:12.675
He opened it up.

31
00:02:12.676 --> 00:02:18.676
"Wow! Look at this," he said with excitement.

32
00:02:18.677 --> 00:02:23.287
The old man was standing inside a large arena.

33
00:02:23.288 --> 00:02:27.634
The seats were filled with cheering people.

34
00:02:27.635 --> 00:02:31.139
Behind the man was a long stage.

35
00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:37.503
Some things were glowing at the end of the stage.

36
00:02:37.504 --> 00:02:40.503
"What are those?"

37
00:02:40.504 --> 00:02:44.227
Vinnie pointed to the glowing objects.

38
00:02:44.228 --> 00:02:46.496
"I count two of them,"

39
00:02:46.497 --> 00:02:50.947
Mandy said, looking carefully at the photo.

40
00:02:50.948 --> 00:02:53.341
"They look like fish."

41
00:02:53.342 --> 00:02:58.606
"Where do you think this is?" wondered Vinnie.

42
00:02:58.607 --> 00:03:01.304
"We’ll soon find out,"

43
00:03:01.305 --> 00:03:05.811
Mandy said, as the glowing light got brighter.

44
00:03:05.812 --> 00:03:13.687
The children’s eyes closed as they fell down the dark tunnel.

45
00:03:13.688 --> 00:03:16.503
"Ow!" cried Vinnie.

46
00:03:16.504 --> 00:03:20.068
He banged his knee on something hard.

47
00:03:20.069 --> 00:03:27.736
Mandy landed right beside her brother in front of an arched doorway.

48
00:03:27.737 --> 00:03:32.785
As soon as they stood up, someone touched their arms.

49
00:03:32.786 --> 00:03:38.745
"Move along, children," said a man wearing a long white robe.

50
00:03:38.746 --> 00:03:41.463
"You must not block the entrance."

51
00:03:41.464 --> 00:03:47.984
The children moved aside as some men walked into the large building.

52
00:03:47.985 --> 00:03:52.754
"Wow!" Vinnie cried as he looked around.

53
00:03:52.755 --> 00:03:56.580
"Are we back in Greece?" asked Vinnie.

54
00:03:56.581 --> 00:04:00.738
Everything he saw reminded him of Greece.

55
00:04:00.739 --> 00:04:04.400
"I don’t think so," said Mandy.

56
00:04:04.401 --> 00:04:08.067
She tried to look through the doorway.

57
00:04:08.068 --> 00:04:13.491
"Women and girls use the door on the side," the large man shouted.

58
00:04:13.492 --> 00:04:17.468
"You come with me, dear," said a woman.

59
00:04:17.469 --> 00:04:20.234
She grabbed Mandy’s arm.

60
00:04:20.235 --> 00:04:25.216
"But . . . but . . . " Mandy tried to explain.

61
00:04:25.217 --> 00:04:32.925
The woman led her away.

